 "remarks": "Stunning modern transitional home built by Compo Luxury Homes in 2024 and ideally located just minutes to downtown Westport, Compo Beach, and the train. Set on .65 acres with city water, sewer, and natural gas, this beautifully designed residence offers over 8,000 square feet across four finished levels with 6 bedrooms, 6 full and 2 half baths. The open floor plan features a chef's kitchen with high-end appliances, spacious living and entertaining areas, and a luxurious primary suite. The walk-out lower level includes a full gym with natural light and additional flexible space for recreation or guests, while the finished third floor offers ideal space for an office( or guest room), bonus room and full bath. Outdoor living includes a covered porch, stone patio, an outdoor shower, and a 16' x 32' heated gunite pool with automatic cover. Additional highlights include wide-plank floors, custom millwork, a whole-house generator, EV chargers, and a three-car garage, all in the sought-after Westport school district.",
